    {
      "sentence_id": 16,
      "text": "= =\n Appearance :\n For the Petitioner/s : Mr.Rajesh Ranjan Kumar\n For the Opposite Party/s : Mr. Amit Prakash (Ga 13)\n ======================================================\n Coram: Honourable Mr. Justice Sandeep Kumar\n Oral Order\n2 15-03-2023",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 474,
      "end": 717,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Rajesh Ranjan Kumar",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 519,
          "end": 538
        },
        {
          "text": "Amit Prakash",
          "label": "LAWYER",
          "start": 571,
          "end": 583
        },
        {
          "text": "Sandeep Kumar",
          "label": "JUDGE",
          "start": 679,
          "end": 692
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "Heard the parties.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 718,
      "end": 737,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "It has been contended by the learned counsel for the petitioner that the LAARA, Gaya and some other authorities are not functioning because their Presiding Officers are retired.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 738,
      "end": 916,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "LAARA",
          "label": "ORG",
          "start": 812,
          "end": 817
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaya",
          "label": "OTHER_PERSON",
          "start": 819,
          "end": 823
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "It is very strange that these authorities which are very important authorities under the The Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition, Rehabilitation and Resettlement Act,\n2013 are being kept vacant by the government which is a litigant before those authorities.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 917,
      "end": 1203,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Right to Fair Compensation and Transparency in Land Acquisition, Rehabilitation and Resettlement Act,\n2013",
          "label": "STATUTE",
          "start": 1011,
          "end": 1117
        }
      ],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 20,
      "text": "The Principal Secretary/ Additional Chief Secretary, Department of Revenue and Land Reforms will see to it that all the vacancies are filled up within three weeks from today failing which Principal Secretary/ Additional Chief Secretary will personally appear on the next date of hearing.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1204,
      "end": 1492,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "Patna High Court C. REV. No.38 of 2023(2) dt.15-03-2023",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 1493,
      "end": 1548,
      "entities": [
        {
          "text": "Patna High Court",
          "label": "COURT",
